===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|handar|hendur|33=höndur}}

# a [[hand]]{{jump|is|hand|s}}
#: ''Mér er illt í '''höndinni'''.''
#:: My '''hand''' hurts.
# [[side]], [[hand]]{{jump|is|side|s}}
#: ''Og á ykkar hægri '''hönd''' sjáið þið Esjuna.''
#:: And on your right '''hand''' you can see the Esja.

