====Usage notes====
* Written as {{term|hönd|lang=is}} in the dative instead of {{term|hendi|lang=is}} when pertaining to [[handwriting]].
* The plural nominative form {{term|höndur||hands|lang=is}} is [[archaic]] and [[dated]].
* Alternative form {{term|hendi|lang=is}} is sometimes used for nominative and accusative singular in [[non-standard]] [[colloquial]] speech; especially regarding sports.

